  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Help Women Impacted by Conflict Access Education</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Around the world, 82.4 million individuals, mostly women and children, have been forced to be displaced. Under these fragile and conflict affected situations, only 13% of females are enrolled in higher education. This project will work towards raising funds to help women under these circumstances continue their higher education.</narrative>
  </description>
